  "goodToKnow": "Die Etappe is a stage or leg of a journey or race: die Etappen der Tour de France, eine Reise in Etappen. Figuratively, ein Etappensieg is a partial victory, a step towards the goal. It's used for projects and careers too: die nächste Etappe. In military history, die Etappe was the rear area behind the front. From French étape. Stress on the second syllable: e-TA-pe. Plural: die Etappen."
